WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:04.200
Priya Natarajan: Can you tell me about a flaky test you fixed?

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.300
Sam O'Neill: Sure. We had a checkout test failing about one run in ten.

3
00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:18.900
Sam O'Neill: It waited on a fixed sleep, so I replaced it with an explicit wait on the order API.

4
00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Priya Natarajan: What happened to the failure rate?
